Input: {"question": "What position does Andriy Shevchenko currently or formerly hold?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 128, "text": "As the sun set over the charming streets of Bagnolet, a sense of community settled over the residents of this small French town."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 129, "end": 238, "text": "In a quaint café on Rue de la République, a group of locals gathered to discuss the latest town hall meeting."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 239, "end": 408, "text": "Amidst the lively chatter, a tall, dark-haired man with piercing blue eyes listened intently, his Ukrainian accent subtly evident as he nodded along to the conversation."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 409, "end": 578, "text": "Andriy Shevchenko, a renowned journalist and politician, had made a name for himself in Ukraine, but few knew of his quiet involvement in the local politics of Bagnolet."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 579, "end": 729, "text": "As a conseiller municipal, he worked tirelessly behind the scenes to ensure the town's growth and development aligned with the needs of its residents."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 730, "end": 838, "text": "Madame Dupont, the café owner, poured Andriy a steaming cup of coffee, her eyes twinkling with appreciation."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 839, "end": 899, "text": "\"Merci, Andriy, for your help with the new community center."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 900, "end": 956, "text": "The children are thrilled to have a safe place to play.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 957, "end": 1041, "text": "Andriy smiled, his eyes crinkling at the corners, as he took a sip of the rich brew."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1042, "end": 1152, "text": "Nearby, a group of young men, fresh from a soccer match, burst into the café, laughing and teasing each other."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1153, "end": 1235, "text": "One of them, a lanky teenager with a messy mop of hair, caught Andriy's attention."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1236, "end": 1268, "text": "\"Ah, Antoine, how was the game?\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1269, "end": 1304, "text": "Andriy asked, his interest genuine."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1305, "end": 1465, "text": "The boy's face lit up as he recounted the match, and Andriy listened attentively, his mind already turning over ways to support the local youth sports programs."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1466, "end": 1579, "text": "As the evening wore on, Andriy excused himself, citing a meeting with the mayor to discuss the upcoming festival."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1580, "end": 1741, "text": "The patrons of the café bid him farewell, their faces reflecting a sense of gratitude and respect for the man who had become an integral part of their community."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 100, "text": "**Breaking News: Football Legend Andriy Shevchenko Takes on New Role as People's Deputy of Ukraine**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 102, "end": 283, "text": "Kiev, Ukraine - In a surprising turn of events, Ukrainian football legend Andriy Shevchenko has traded in his cleats for a seat in the Verkhovna Rada, Ukraine's national parliament."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 284, "end": 421, "text": "According to official records and sources close to the parliament, Shevchenko has indeed taken on the role of People's Deputy of Ukraine."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 422, "end": 516, "text": "This development comes as a shock to many, given Shevchenko's illustrious career on the pitch."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 517, "end": 660, "text": "The former AC Milan and Chelsea striker is Ukraine's all-time leading scorer and has won numerous accolades, including the Ballon d'Or in 2004."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 661, "end": 798, "text": "However, it appears that Shevchenko has set his sights on a new challenge, using his platform to make a difference in Ukrainian politics."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 799, "end": 1005, "text": "\"Andriy Shevchenko's decision to enter politics is a testament to his commitment to Ukraine and its people,\" said Oleksandr Tkachenko, a fellow People's Deputy and member of the Servant of the People party."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1006, "end": 1114, "text": "\"His reputation as a dedicated and hardworking individual will undoubtedly serve him well in this new role.\""}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1115, "end": 1275, "text": "According to data from the Verkhovna Rada's official website, Shevchenko was elected as a People's Deputy in 2019, representing the Servant of the People party."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1276, "end": 1403, "text": "Since taking office, he has been an active participant in parliamentary proceedings, attending sessions and committee meetings."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1404, "end": 1497, "text": "\"Shevchenko's presence in the Verkhovna Rada has already made a significant impact,\" said Dr."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1498, "end": 1558, "text": "Olexiy Haran, a political analyst at the University of Kiev."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1559, "end": 1747, "text": "\"His celebrity status has drawn attention to important issues, such as education and healthcare reform, and his willingness to listen and learn has earned him respect from his colleagues.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1748, "end": 1922, "text": "While some have questioned Shevchenko's lack of political experience, others argue that his fresh perspective and commitment to public service are exactly what Ukraine needs."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1923, "end": 2072, "text": "\"Andriy Shevchenko's decision to enter politics is a breath of fresh air,\" said Natalia Korolevska, a Ukrainian journalist and political commentator."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2073, "end": 2155, "text": "\"He brings a level of enthusiasm and dedication that is often lacking in politics."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2156, "end": 2225, "text": "I have no doubt that he will make a positive impact in his new role.\""}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "conseiller municipal", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Andriy Shevchenko", "scope": "currently or formerly", "claim": "Andriy Shevchenko currently or formerly holds the position of conseiller municipal.", "answer": "conseiller municipal", "quote": "As a conseiller municipal, he worked tirelessly behind the scenes to ensure the town's growth and development aligned with the needs of its residents.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["conseiller municipal", "People's Deputy of Ukraine"]}
